<http://data.silknow.org/object/481c6179-d01a-3083-9f60-64fcef6d4398/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric, woven silk and cotton brocaded with silk and metal thread.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: white, blue and yellow silk.\nWeft: Z-spun white cotton.\nBrocading wefts: dark blue and green silk and gilt metal strip S-wound on yellow silk core and silver metal strip S-wound on white silk core.\nStripes:\n[1] gilt metal forming a chevron on a yellow ground.\n[2] white ground with a small flower, stem and leaves in silver.\n[3] wider stripe with a silver star-like flower filling the entire width and with a sinuous stem of leaves growing above it.\n[4] repeat of [2].\n[5] repeat of [1]."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/481c6179-d01a-3083-9f60-64fcef6d4398> .

